# The head locked onto the CD block's hub (game/target.h; boot_at hub: stood facing west, 150 short
# of the lift's pad). Its mark is at the top of the lift, the pickup's hatch over the pad (the
# user, 2026-11-16: "it would be better if the target marker was on the top of the elevator, so
# players can see where it goes"): locked, the head looks up the beam to it. X takes the nearest on
# the left, Z on the right: one of them is the hub's (it's straight ahead)
boot_at hub
wait_up
wait 1.0
shot hl_00_ahead
press x
wait 1.0
shot hl_01_locked_x
press x
wait 1.0
press z
wait 1.0
shot hl_02_locked_z
hold down 1.5
wait 0.5
shot hl_03_backed_off
